{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51218","headline":"五言白话诗 二十五 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚沾一百年，八十最是老。\n逢头捉将去，无老亦无小。\n须臾得暂时，恰同霜下草。\n横遭狂风吹，总即连根倒。\n悠悠度今日，今夜谁能保。\n语你愚痴人，急修未来道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}